  "description": "Groups executor. 2026-06-01 FIX: if TargetJson.id (group id) is missing, resolve it from ArgsJson.groupSiteUrl via SharePoint _api/site/groupId. Compose_Effective_GroupId = coalesce(TargetJson.id, Args.groupId, site-resolved). Agent site-access jobs that pass a site URL (not a group id) now succeed instead of failing missing_groupId. #flowstudio-mcp"
